SUMMARY:Ride the C & D Canal 34 miles F RSVP Required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Let’s do one of our f
 avorite rides!**\n\n**On Saturday\, join friends from both the Lancaster C
 lub and Rails to Trails with a ride on the C and D Canal. The ride starts 
 at 10 am from the parking lot from Schaeffer’s Canal House\, Please park
  in the lot closest to the bridge. Chesapeake City and we will ride 16 mil
 es to Delaware City where we will stop for ice cream. We will ride back\, 
 and at the end of the trail\, we can eat lunch at Schaeffer’s Canal Hous
 e. Please park in the lot furthest past the restaurant or at the nearby C 
 & D Canal parking lot.**\n**This is a casual ride. Please do not sign up f
 or this ride unless you promise to stay with the group. No one left behind
 .**\n**Helmets are required. Please do not put the leader in an embarrassi
 ng situation by begging someone to wear a helmet. Have a tube for your bik
 e so someone can fix a flat. This is a paved trail. Any kind of bike will 
 do.**\n**Richard Conner leader 717-572-8480**\nTo eliminate passing around
  a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP b
 elow to join this ride.\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a club memb
 er. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&
 club_id=257148).\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code
  of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&
 club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https://lancbikec
 lub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=32515
 9) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)
 \nRichard Conner leader 717-572-8480
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3148433
 38/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260518T113147Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260518T113147Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
